<title>USA: IPO FILING - Orckit Communications Ltd.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Orckit Communications Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		Orckit Communications Ltd</p>
<p>Stock symbol			ORCTF.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-14/ordinary shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  800,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    14,134,960</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  495,000 shrs Business: Tel Aviv-based company designs, develops, manufactures and markets digital subscriber line systems that enable telephone companies to provide efficient, high-speed digital transmission of data, voice and video over existing telephone networks.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: For product development, increased marketing activities, particularly in the United States, working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		   $3,454		 $432</p>
<p>   - Net Income (Loss)     (2,205)		(679)</p>
